OL,3,ARyan Reynolds and Rob Mac buy historic
OL,4,AWrexham football pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pub and its landlord, Wayne Jones,
OL,7,Fhave become regular features on the
OL,8,Faward-winning "Welcome to Wrexham"
OL,9,FDisney documentary series, and Jones
OL,10,Fdescribed the buy as "great news for
OL,11,Fall Wrexham fans".
